{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1715 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "f251863ef993549f93dd0552f1f37097f3d03dc89614d61dd641cd36cf97a285" :edb/db-before-t 1714 :edb/db-after-t 1715 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535027 50 #inst "2026-10-08T15:06:43.971Z" 13194139535027 true] [17592186096589 1020 #edb/ref 17592186327581 13194139535027 true] [17592186096853 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535027 true] [17592186096853 1100 "Calculate\n\n$∫(4\\cos^{2} x - 2)dx$." 13194139535027 false] [17592186096853 1100 "Calculate\n$\\int (4{cos}^{2}⁡x-2)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139535027 true] [17592186096853 1145 "Here, we use the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${cos}^{2}⁡x$ term, given by\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x=2{cos}^{2}⁡x-1.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+1).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (4{cos}^{2}⁡x-2)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (4(\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+1))-2)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+2-2)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2(\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x)+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327581 1017 #edb/ref 17592186327582 13194139535027 true] [17592186327581 1089 "q-51126" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327581 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535027 true] [17592186327581 1100 "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /24}({cos}^{2}⁡2x-{sin}^{2}⁡2x)\\text{d}x=$" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327581 1113 #uuid "d3c3918e-b0d8-54bc-84f9-50f26c7e5758" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327581 1145 "Here, we use the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =2x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x={cos}^{2}⁡2x-{sin}^{2}⁡2x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /24}({cos}^{2}⁡2x-{sin}^{2}⁡2x)\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /24}\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x}{4}{|}_{0}^{\\pi /24} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{24})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\cdot 0)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡0] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}(\\frac{1}{2}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327582 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327583 13194139535027 true] [17592186327582 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327584 13194139535027 true] [17592186327582 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327585 13194139535027 true] [17592186327582 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327586 13194139535027 true] [17592186327582 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327587 13194139535027 true] [17592186327582 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535027 true] [17592186327582 1041 "selection" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327582 1104 #edb/ref 17592186327583 13194139535027 true] [17592186327582 1110 #uuid "20bf7902-d8bf-522c-b9ef-2ee403332062" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327583 1034 "\\frac{1}{8}" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327583 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535027 true] [17592186327583 1111 #uuid "297647da-3ab3-5dcc-9a0f-48a9dc1e495f" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327584 1034 "\\frac{2}{3}" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327584 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535027 true] [17592186327584 1111 #uuid "ae3104d2-922a-56ba-ad75-57e2cb7a3a3c" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327585 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327585 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535027 true] [17592186327585 1111 #uuid "d2af47ef-76c7-5f0b-8538-94f85021dbeb" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327586 1034 "\\frac{1}{4}" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327586 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535027 true] [17592186327586 1111 #uuid "d65d5927-bfb8-5799-9a36-4be823721147" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327587 1034 "\\frac{3}{8}" 13194139535027 true] [17592186327587 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535027 true] [17592186327587 1111 